260
00:20:30,479 --> 00:20:31,731
What the heck?

261
00:20:34,066 --> 00:20:35,401
Did I miss my dose?

262
00:20:35,484 --> 00:20:36,944
No, I'm sure I took it.

263
00:20:38,863 --> 00:20:40,698
Is it because I should be asleep?

264
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:48,706
Oh, whatever!

265
00:20:54,879 --> 00:20:56,297
What is going on?

266
00:21:18,486 --> 00:21:19,570
Hey, move.

267
00:21:19,653 --> 00:21:20,905
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

268
00:21:22,281 --> 00:21:23,699
Oh.

269
00:21:27,328 --> 00:21:28,329
-My bad.
-Uh…

270
00:21:28,996 --> 00:21:31,499
Chopsticks go in the front.

271
00:21:32,291 --> 00:21:35,169
- Huh? Ah. Ah.
- Here.

272
00:21:35,753 --> 00:21:37,171
That's not it.

273
00:21:37,254 --> 00:21:38,255
Put them here.

274
00:21:38,339 --> 00:21:40,090
Wait, what? No, no, no.

275
00:21:40,174 --> 00:21:43,260
- That's wrong. Hey, no, in front of you.
- That's the correct way.

276
00:21:43,344 --> 00:21:44,845
- No, like this.
- You're wrong.

277
00:21:44,929 --> 00:21:46,222
They go in front.

278
00:21:46,305 --> 00:21:47,515
Okay, okay. I get it.

279
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:50,643
- Okay. So mine go here.
- Mm-hmm.

280
00:21:51,685 --> 00:21:53,729
And yours go there.

281
00:21:53,813 --> 00:21:55,815
-Go right here. Okay.
-Yeah. Okay.

282
00:21:57,316 --> 00:21:58,484
