291
00:22:43,445 --> 00:22:45,447
-My favorite? It's red.
-Mmm.

292
00:22:45,531 --> 00:22:46,782
-Huh?
-This color.

293
00:22:46,866 --> 00:22:48,868
-Oh, that's red. Ah.
-Mm-hmm.

294
00:22:51,871 --> 00:22:54,248
-No. No, you can't see.
-What?

295
00:22:54,331 --> 00:22:56,959
- You don't get to see it.
- How come I can't? Why not?

296
00:22:57,042 --> 00:22:58,168
Mmm.

297
