299
00:23:04,717 --> 00:23:06,385
-Huh?
-Here, look at it.

300
00:23:06,468 --> 00:23:07,469
-Plushies.
-Aw.

301
00:23:07,553 --> 00:23:09,680
- Look how cute these are.
- Oh! Pig?

302
00:23:09,763 --> 00:23:11,056
-Pig. Pig.
-Pig? You pig?

303
00:23:11,140 --> 00:23:12,975
- You pig?
- I am not a pig.

304
00:23:13,058 --> 00:23:14,226
What the heck?

305
00:23:14,310 --> 00:23:17,021
