331
00:24:17,831 --> 00:24:19,166
Right.

332
00:24:20,542 --> 00:24:23,629
Wait a sec, are you… gonna exhibit too?

333
00:24:23,712 --> 00:24:26,215
- Of course.
- Are you some kind of idiot?

334
00:24:26,298 --> 00:24:29,259
You might as well give up now,
because you're not gonna make it.

335
00:24:30,928 --> 00:24:33,138
I'm sweeping the comps again this year.

336
00:24:33,973 --> 00:24:34,974
You should just chill.

337
00:24:37,643 --> 00:24:40,229
Well, see you at the Festa, Sleepyhead.

338
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,648
Whoa.

339
00:24:46,276 --> 00:24:47,277
You're a hottie.

340
00:24:47,778 --> 00:24:49,029
Hot guy.

341
00:24:55,786 --> 00:24:56,954
-Hmm.
-Hmm.

342
00:25:17,850 --> 00:25:20,060
-It's hot.
-Thank you.

343
00:25:32,865 --> 00:25:34,116
Hmm.

344
00:25:35,743 --> 00:25:37,494
Who was that guy earlier?

345
00:25:39,329 --> 00:25:41,665
That really smug-looking guy?

346
00:25:46,545 --> 00:25:48,130
We went to college together.

347
00:25:49,131 --> 00:25:50,883
He's a real jerk.

348
00:25:50,966 --> 00:25:53,427
But he's also a three-time Festa winner.

349
00:25:56,263 --> 00:25:57,264
Ah.

350
00:25:57,973 --> 00:25:58,974
"Sleepyhead"?

351
00:26:00,309 --> 00:26:03,145
"Sleepyhead." What is that,
like, your nickname?

352
00:26:05,856 --> 00:26:07,024
Mm-hmm.

353
00:26:17,701 --> 00:26:19,870
- Aren't you cold?
- Oh, uh…

354
00:26:19,953 --> 00:26:21,789
It's not that cold actually.

355
00:26:22,456 --> 00:26:23,707
I'm feeling toasty.

356
00:26:29,088 --> 00:26:30,756
Should we hold hands?

357
00:26:32,424 --> 00:26:33,425
Huh?

358
00:26:45,979 --> 00:26:48,357
Karin? Karin, Karin!

359
00:26:49,733 --> 00:26:51,902
Karin, Karin.

360
00:26:53,195 --> 00:26:55,823
Karin! Karin! Karin!

361
00:26:55,906 --> 00:26:57,157
W-Will you watch her?

362
00:26:57,241 --> 00:26:58,575
I-I'm gonna go get help.

363
00:27:03,789 --> 00:27:05,415
Should we call an ambulance?

364
