He just left her
lying there and ran off.

365
00:27:13,799 --> 00:27:16,385
She passed out holding hands?

366
00:27:16,468 --> 00:27:18,345
What if he kissed her?

367
00:27:18,428 --> 00:27:20,472
She could die
if you touch her.

368
00:27:24,226 --> 00:27:26,979
Hey, Reiji.
Don't you have a major crush on Karin?

369
00:27:27,062 --> 00:27:28,564
What? No way.

370
00:27:29,064 --> 00:27:33,277
Are you an idiot? Why would I be
interested in that sleepyhead? Come on.

371
00:27:37,197 --> 00:27:40,075
She's a sleeping love fairy.

372
00:27:40,158 --> 00:27:44,746
<i>I was teased for a long time</i>
<i>all because of him.</i>

373
00:27:48,792 --> 00:27:52,921
When I'm stressed out
or when my emotions get too intense,

374
00:27:53,005 --> 00:27:55,757
my nervous system gets all out of whack.

375
00:27:56,300 --> 00:27:58,594
It's like a switch shutting my body down.

376
00:27:59,803 --> 00:28:00,804
Switch, huh?

377
00:28:01,430 --> 00:28:02,472
Mm-hmm.

378
00:28:03,891 --> 00:28:06,018
I short circuit like some kind of robot.

379
00:28:07,603 --> 00:28:08,770
I just pass out.

380
00:28:23,911 --> 00:28:26,330
But what I've decided…

381
