as a star falling.

382
00:28:32,669 --> 00:28:35,339
A star falling?

383
00:28:35,422 --> 00:28:36,506
Mm-hmm.

384
00:28:37,841 --> 00:28:41,178
It's like my heart shines so brightly
that it had to…

385
00:28:42,387 --> 00:28:44,556
go dark and rest for a little while.

386
00:28:47,184 --> 00:28:50,395
And when I wake up,
it's magically recharged.

387
00:29:01,073 --> 00:29:03,700
I'm making sure
you take first place.

388
00:29:05,953 --> 00:29:06,954
Hmm?

389
00:29:07,663 --> 00:29:09,122
Just trust me.

390
00:29:13,794 --> 00:29:15,379
-What?
-Just trust me.

391
00:29:15,462 --> 00:29:17,297
-Trust you with what?
-Mmm.

392
00:29:20,133 --> 00:29:21,134
Hmm.

393
00:29:21,802 --> 00:29:24,972
Karin, I am your worker.

394
00:29:25,472 --> 00:29:26,640
Put your trust in me.

395
00:29:27,849 --> 00:29:30,686
We're gonna win!

396
00:29:49,788 --> 00:29:51,289
PRAYING FOR VICTORY
BUY NECESSARY SUPPLIES

397
