425
00:31:39,147 --> 00:31:41,525
-You're not done yet. Let' go!
-That's it.

426
00:31:42,484 --> 00:31:45,237
Kunam! Wait, hey, hang on!

427
00:31:46,113 --> 00:31:47,322
