447
00:32:26,570 --> 00:32:28,113
Mmm. Mmm.

448
00:32:28,613 --> 00:32:31,449
Nice. Well done.

449
00:32:31,533 --> 00:32:33,285
Good work.

450
00:32:35,162 --> 00:32:38,290
All right, so now… Uh…

451
00:32:38,790 --> 00:32:40,000
Okay.

452
00:32:41,042 --> 00:32:47,924
From here,
and then like this here…

453
00:32:57,767 --> 00:32:59,603
The staff will then…

454
00:33:09,654 --> 00:33:11,239
Okay. I got it.

455
00:33:14,576 --> 00:33:19,122
