456
00:33:19,706 --> 00:33:20,957
- My goal?
- Mmm.

457
00:33:22,375 --> 00:33:23,460
Hmm.

458
00:33:24,044 --> 00:33:25,045
I…

459
00:33:25,629 --> 00:33:26,838
Hmm.

460
00:33:30,050 --> 00:33:31,968
It's not a huge one,

461
00:33:32,052 --> 00:33:35,055
