to feel the spirit of Charo Island.

462
00:33:37,349 --> 00:33:38,725
- Get the feel of it?
- Mm-hmm.

463
00:33:38,808 --> 00:33:40,977
I want to share
the warmth and sincerity

464
00:33:41,061 --> 00:33:42,979
