-Mm-hmm.

471
00:34:17,347 --> 00:34:18,682
Oh. Wait a minute.

472
00:34:18,765 --> 00:34:20,267
- Wait a minute. Mmm…
- Hmm.

473
00:34:21,059 --> 00:34:23,353
