-Yeah. Mm-hmm.

484
00:34:45,709 --> 00:34:49,629
I am moneyless.
That means my money is gone, yes?

485
00:34:49,713 --> 00:34:50,922
- I got scammed.
- Uh-huh.

486
00:34:51,006 --> 00:34:52,215
- Scammed, yeah.
- Uh-huh.

487
00:34:52,299 --> 00:34:54,009
He told me, "Fall seven times,

488
00:34:54,092 --> 00:34:55,802
