-I see.

489
00:34:57,304 --> 00:34:58,346
Stand up eight.

490
00:34:59,055 --> 00:35:00,849
Mmm. You're right.

491
00:35:01,474 --> 00:35:03,143
-Let's do our best. Mmm.
-Mmm.

492
00:35:06,771 --> 00:35:08,690
<i>Hello. </i>

493
00:35:14,029 --> 00:35:15,697
Ugh…

494
00:35:15,780 --> 00:35:17,115
