506
00:35:54,235 --> 00:35:57,197
Take a look. Give it a spin. See that?

507
00:35:57,906 --> 00:35:59,199
-I think it needs…
-Mm-hmm.

508
00:35:59,282 --> 00:36:01,201
-…a little bit of tape.
-Ah, okay.

509
00:36:01,785 --> 00:36:03,745
- Hey, hold on.
- Wait, wait.

510
00:36:03,828 --> 00:36:05,538
STRATEGY MEETING

511
00:36:05,622 --> 00:36:06,623
What?

512
00:36:08,083 --> 00:36:10,418
- This one.
<i>- </i>No, no, no. This one.

513
00:36:10,502 --> 00:36:12,962
- Why are you-- What?
- Wait. Gosh, hold on.

514
00:36:13,046 --> 00:36:16,091
- It has to go that way.
- No, it's this--

515
00:36:16,174 --> 00:36:19,511
No, the lights,
they should go all around. Shoo!

516
00:36:19,594 --> 00:36:21,388
- Bam!
- No, it's more like, wham!

517
00:36:21,471 --> 00:36:23,431
I'm in charge.
Designer, designer.

518
00:36:23,515 --> 00:36:24,516
But I'm the leader.

519
00:36:26,017 --> 00:36:27,018
Rock, paper, scissors!

520
00:36:27,102 --> 00:36:28,436
One more time.

521
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:29,688
Best out of three. Ready?

522
00:36:49,249 --> 00:36:51,543
Uh… Are you looking
for something, Karin?

523
00:36:54,504 --> 00:36:55,505
Will this work?

524
00:36:56,047 --> 00:36:57,799
Oh. Thank you.

525
00:36:58,299 --> 00:36:59,300
All right then.

526
00:36:59,384 --> 00:37:00,802
-"Hello."
-"Hello."

527
00:37:00,885 --> 00:37:03,096
-"Let's get to work."
-"Let's get to work."

528
00:37:03,179 --> 00:37:05,098
-"This way."
-"This way."

529
00:37:05,181 --> 00:37:07,183
-"It's okay."
-"It's okay."

530
00:37:07,267 --> 00:37:10,520
"This way. That way. Together."

531
00:37:10,603 --> 00:37:13,898
You're learning this
because of Yubin, right?

532
00:37:13,982 --> 00:37:18,653
No, I… No, the Festa. The Festa!
We're prepping it together.

533
00:37:18,737 --> 00:37:21,030
The communication is a little difficult.

534
00:37:21,114 --> 00:37:22,323
I get it. That's great!

535
00:37:23,199 --> 00:37:24,784
Let's cheer each other on!

536
00:37:25,368 --> 00:37:27,328
Yeah, okay. Thanks a lot.

537
00:37:27,412 --> 00:37:29,330
Uh, th-thanks. Thanks.

538
00:37:29,414 --> 00:37:30,999
COMMUNICATION CLASS

539
00:37:33,835 --> 00:37:35,503
FINAL CHECKS

540
00:37:45,972 --> 00:37:49,726
This looks delicious!
Thank you! Wow!

541
00:37:50,310 --> 00:37:51,352
Mmm…

542
00:37:56,858 --> 00:37:59,235
Hey, Chief, the inventory's complete.

543
00:37:59,319 --> 00:38:02,614
It would be a good idea for us to bring
some extra strawberry jam along.

544
00:38:02,697 --> 00:38:03,698
Sounds good.

545
00:38:03,782 --> 00:38:07,035
As soon as we finish up here,
we'll take everything out to the cars.

546
00:38:07,619 --> 00:38:09,287
Sounds like a plan.

547
00:38:20,006 --> 00:38:21,049
<i>Look how pretty.</i>

548
00:38:30,558 --> 00:38:32,644
<i>Just like my strawberries, right?</i>

549
00:38:37,982 --> 00:38:39,442
Great work today.

550
00:38:39,526 --> 00:38:41,152
Great work to you too.

551
00:38:41,236 --> 00:38:42,821
All right.

552
00:38:46,241 --> 00:38:48,535
- Here.
- Oh, sorry, but

553
00:38:48,618 --> 00:38:53,289
- drinking alcohol isn't for me.
- Huh? Oh, I see.

554
00:38:53,957 --> 00:38:55,083
In that case…

555
00:38:55,166 --> 00:38:57,085
Just a moment.

556
00:38:58,253 --> 00:39:01,714
- I'll be right back. Wait.
- Oh? Hmm?

557
00:39:11,349 --> 00:39:12,475
Huh?

558
00:39:13,518 --> 00:39:15,353
What's with the helmet?

559
00:39:15,436 --> 00:39:17,689
It's like my armor.

560
00:39:17,772 --> 00:39:20,483
-Just in case I faint or something.
-Mmm.

561
00:39:21,734 --> 00:39:22,735
Okay.

562
00:39:23,820 --> 00:39:26,739
Whoo-hoo, it's been so long!

563
00:39:28,408 --> 00:39:29,659
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

564
00:39:35,707 --> 00:39:37,542
Mmm.

565
00:39:38,042 --> 00:39:39,794
-Isn't it good?
-Mm-hmm.

566
00:39:40,295 --> 00:39:42,714
It tastes amazing
'cause it's been a while.

567
00:39:42,797 --> 00:39:44,048
Mmm.

568
00:39:50,221 --> 00:39:51,347
So, hey.

569
00:39:51,931 --> 00:39:56,394
Don't you get scared living here alone?

570
00:39:56,477 --> 00:39:58,479
I like living alone. You're more scary.

571
00:39:59,981 --> 00:40:00,982
Huh?

572
00:40:01,065 --> 00:40:02,901
Come on, now.

573
00:40:08,489 --> 00:40:09,616
It's just that…

574
00:40:11,951 --> 00:40:15,830
I've always felt like a burden
to every single person in my life.

575
00:40:18,499 --> 00:40:20,668
Everyone is always worrying because

576
00:40:21,711 --> 00:40:24,380
I could collapse anywhere at any second.

577
00:40:26,174 --> 00:40:27,842
It's always bothered me.

578
00:40:34,307 --> 00:40:39,020
That's why I've made it my mission
to prove to the world

579
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:41,356
that I can make it on my own.

580
00:40:42,690 --> 00:40:44,859
And I don't need anybody's help at all.

581
00:40:53,910 --> 00:40:55,703
It's okay to depend on others.

582
00:40:57,330 --> 00:40:58,331
There's no shame in that.

583
00:41:00,166 --> 00:41:01,376
Plus, you've got me.

584
00:41:02,126 --> 00:41:05,296
I'll catch you every time you faint.

585
00:41:05,380 --> 00:41:07,799
Like the first time we met.

586
00:41:08,967 --> 00:41:12,971
I'll hold you like this, okay?

587
00:41:13,054 --> 00:41:15,098
When did I ever--

588
00:41:20,436 --> 00:41:22,397
What I meant to say was…

589
00:41:24,983 --> 00:41:26,275
you don't need the helmet.

590
00:41:29,529 --> 00:41:30,738
Because with me,

591
00:41:32,573 --> 00:41:34,033
you don't have to be ashamed.

592
00:41:53,553 --> 00:41:54,804
I'll trust you, Yubin.

593
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:59,100
You can trust me.

594
00:43:16,010 --> 00:43:18,262
MERRY BERRY LOVE

595
00:43:18,346 --> 00:43:19,430
NEXT EPISODE

596
00:43:19,514 --> 00:43:21,599
<i>The day's finally here.</i>

597
00:43:21,682 --> 00:43:23,226
<i> It's all right.</i>
<i>Everything will work out.</i>

598
00:43:23,309 --> 00:43:25,812
They are uncannily similar.

599
00:43:25,895 --> 00:43:29,524
Green Nova Corporation Festa,
the winner is…
